INSERT INTO `academic_questions` VALUES (1,1,1,25,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH01_Q001','What was the first home of the bird made of?','Leaves','Straw','A little round shell','Twigs','C','A little round shell','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(2,1,1,26,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH02_Q001','What did the husband want to buy in his daydream?','Sheep','Cows','Horses','Goats','B','Cows','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(3,1,1,28,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH04_Q001','According to the poem, where do wild strawberries grow best?','In gardens','By woodland trickling streams','On farm fields','In flower pots','B','By woodland trickling streams','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(4,1,1,31,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH07_Q001','Which sport is Major Dhyan Chand famously associated with?','Cricket','Football','Hockey','Badminton','C','Hockey','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(5,1,1,30,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH06_Q001','What is the opposite of the word \"Remember\"?','Forget','Recall','Memorize','Ignore','A','Forget','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(6,1,1,27,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH03_Q001','Which of the following is a good listening habit?','Interrupting the speaker frequently','Looking away while someone talks','Paying close attention and trying to understand','Fidgeting with objects','C','Paying close attention and trying to understand','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(7,1,1,29,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH05_Q001','Why did the stepmother send Marushka into the forest in mid-winter?','To play in the snow','To fetch violets and strawberries','To collect firewood','To find a lost sheep','B','To fetch violets and strawberries','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(8,1,1,34,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH10_Q001','What did the wise third brother do with his sack of rice?','He sold it for money','He ate it with his family','He sowed it in the field to grow a rich crop','He stored it in a cellar','C','He sowed it in the field to grow a rich crop','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(9,1,1,31,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH07_Q002','Identify the adjective in the sentence: \"The brave soldier saved the puppy.\"','Soldier','Brave','Saved','Puppy','B','Brave','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(10,1,1,32,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH08_Q001','Choose the correct synonym for the word \"Delighted\":','Sad','Overjoyed','Angry','Tired','B','Overjoyed','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(11,1,1,33,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH09_Q001','What type of creature is the Triantiwontigongolope in the poem?','A real wild animal from Asia','A completely imaginary, funny insect','A sea mammal','A prehistoric bird','B','A completely imaginary, funny insect','Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(12,1,1,26,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH02_Q002','Which moral lesson is best reflected in the story Daydreams?','Always plan for the future','Unrealistic idle thinking without action leads to silly arguments','Animals are difficult to maintain','Neighbors should not talk to each other','B','Unrealistic idle thinking without action leads to silly arguments','Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(13,1,1,30,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH06_Q002','Which sentence correctly uses the Past Continuous Tense?','The birds fly high in the sky.','The birds will fly in the sky.','The birds were flying in the sky.','The birds flew in the sky.','C','The birds were flying in the sky.','Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(14,1,1,27,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH03_Q002','Choose the correct passive voice of: \"The teacher solved the difficult puzzle.\"','The teacher solves the difficult puzzle.','The difficult puzzle was solved by the teacher.','The difficult puzzle is solving the teacher.','The teacher has solved the puzzle.','B','The difficult puzzle was solved by the teacher.','Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(15,1,1,32,1,'MH_05_ENG_CH08_Q002','Select the option containing a pair of ANTONYMS:','Courage – Bravery','Humble – Proud','Swift – Fast','Silent – Quiet','B','Humble – Proud','Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(16,1,2,59,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH01_Q001','\'नाच रे मोरा\' या गाण्यात मोराला कोठे नाचायला सांगितले आहे?','डोंगरावर','आमराईत','नदीकाठी','घरात','B','आमराईत','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(17,1,2,63,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH05_Q001','\'डराव डराव\' असा आवाज कोणता प्राणी करतो?','कुत्रा','मांजरी','बेडूक','मोर','C','बेडूक','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(18,1,2,68,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH10_Q001','बैलपोळा या सणात कोणाची सजावट करून पूजा केली जाते?','गाईची','बैलांची','घोड्यांची','शेताची','B','बैलांची','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(19,1,2,61,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH03_Q001','\'झाड\' या शब्दाचा समानार्थी शब्द कोणता?','वृक्ष','फुले','पाने','मूळ','A','वृक्ष','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(20,1,2,60,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH02_Q001','सशांना वाचवण्यासाठी हत्तीने कशाचा वापर केला?','लाकडाचा','सोंडेत पाणी भरून खड्ड्यात ओतले','दोरीचा','दगडाचा','B','सोंडेत पाणी भरून खड्ड्यात ओतले','Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(21,1,2,62,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH04_Q001','मिनूला मिळालेली पिसे कोणाची होती?','कावळ्याची','मोराची','बदकाची','कोंबडीची','C','बदकाची','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(22,1,2,61,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH03_Q002','\'रोहन दररोज अभ्यास करतो.\' या वाक्यातील नाम कोणते?','अभ्यास','करतो','रोहन','दररोज','C','रोहन','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(23,1,2,67,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH09_Q001','सिंह आणि बेडकाच्या गोष्टीतून काय शिकायला मिळते?','ताकदीपेक्षा बुद्धी श्रेष्ठ असते आणि गर्वाचे घर खाली असते','मोठ्यांनी लहानांवर अन्याय करावा','ओरडणारा नेहमी जिंकतो','नेहमी पळून जावे','A','ताकदीपेक्षा बुद्धी श्रेष्ठ असते आणि गर्वाचे घर खाली असते','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(24,1,2,61,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH03_Q003','\'मुलगा मैदानावर खेळत आहे.\' या वाक्याचे बहुवचनी रूप काय होईल?','मुले मैदानावर खेळत आहेत.','मुलगा मैदानावर खेळत होते.','मुली मैदानावर खेळत आहेत.','मुले मैदानावर पळत आहेत.','A','मुले मैदानावर खेळत आहेत.','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(25,1,2,61,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH03_Q004','\'दिवस\' या शब्दाचा योग्य विरुद्धार्थी शब्द कोणता?','काळोख','रात्र','सकाळ','दुपार','B','रात्र','Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 08:51:50'),(26,1,2,61,1,'MH_05_MAR_CH03_Q005','\'अहमदनगर\' या शब्दातील अक्षरांपासून खालीलपैकी कोणता अर्थपूर्ण शब्द तयार होत नाही?','नगर','अहम्','मदन'