,'₹ 200','₹ 1,200','₹ 20','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(251,3,15,440,1,'MH_07_Q056','If the HCF of two numbers is 6 and their LCM is 36, and one number is 12, find the other number.','18','24','12','30','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(252,3,15,443,1,'MH_07_Q057','Find the value of x if (2⁴)³ = 2ˣ.','7','12','64','16','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(253,3,15,446,1,'MH_07_Q058','12 workers can build a wall in 8 days. How many days will 6 workers take to complete the same work?','4 days','16 days','12 days','24 days','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(254,3,15,450,1,'MH_07_Q059','In a right-angled triangle, if the base is 6 cm and height is 8 cm, find the hypotenuse.','10 cm','14 cm','12 cm','100 cm','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(255,3,15,451,1,'MH_07_Q060','Expand using identity: (2a + 3b)²','4a² + 9b²','4a² + 12ab + 9b²','4a² + 6ab + 9b²','2a² + 12ab + 3b²','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(256,3,16,453,1,'MH_07_Q061','Which adaptation helps cacti survive in deserts?','Broad leaves','Fleshy stem and modified spine-like leaves','Deep aquatic roots','Thin bark','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(257,3,16,454,1,'MH_07_Q062','Which part of the plant absorbs water and minerals from the soil?','Stem','Leaf','Root','Flower','C',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(258,3,16,455,1,'MH_07_Q063','What is the pH value of pure neutral water?','0','7','14','5','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(259,3,16,458,1,'MH_07_Q064','What is the SI unit of mass?','Gram','Kilogram','Newton','Pound','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(260,3,16,461,1,'MH_07_Q065','What is the unit of temperature in the SI system?','Degree Celsius','Kelvin','Fahrenheit','Joule','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(261,3,16,456,1,'MH_07_Q066','Autotrophic plants prepare their own food by the process called _____.','Respiration','Photosynthesis','Transpiration','Fermentation','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(262,3,16,459,1,'MH_07_Q067','Work done is calculated using which formula?','Work = Force × Displacement','Work = Mass × Acceleration','Work = Distance / Time','Work = Force / Area','A',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(263,3,16,460,1,'MH_07_Q068','Like charges _____ each other, while unlike charges _____ each other.','Attract, Repel','Repel, Attract','Neutralize, Repel','Destroy, Create','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(264,3,16,463,1,'MH_07_Q069','Which organelle is known as the powerhouse of the cell?','Ribosome','Mitochondria','Golgi Body','Nucleus','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(265,3,16,465,1,'MH_07_Q070','Rusting of iron is an example of which type of change?','Physical and reversible','Chemical and irreversible','Periodic and physical','Fast physical change','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(266,3,16,455,1,'MH_07_Q071','Why does water exhibit anomalous expansion between 0°C and 4°C?','Because its density is minimum at 4°C','Because it expands on cooling from 4°C to 0°C','Because it evaporates rapidly','Because hydrogen bonds break completely at 0°C','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(267,3,16,461,1,'MH_07_Q072','By which mode does heat from the Sun reach the Earth through vacuum?','Conduction','Convection','Radiation','Refraction','C',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(268,3,16,467,1,'MH_07_Q073','What is the primary chemical compound present in natural soap made by saponification?','Sodium salt of fatty acids','Calcium carbonate','Sodium chloride','Potassium nitrate','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(269,3,16,470,1,'MH_07_Q074','The frequency of sound determines its pitch. If frequency increases, what happens to pitch?','Pitch decreases','Pitch increases (shrillness increases)','Pitch remains unchanged','Volume becomes zero','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(270,3,16,471,1,'MH_07_Q075','When a magnet is broken into two equal pieces, what happens to its poles?','One piece becomes North pole, other becomes South pole','Each piece becomes an independent magnet with North and South poles','Magnetism is lost completely','Both pieces become North poles','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(271,3,17,473,1,'MH_07_Q076','What causes day and night on Earth?','Revolution of Earth','Rotation of Earth on its axis','Phases of the Moon','Solar flares','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(272,3,17,474,1,'MH_07_Q077','When the Moon comes between the Sun and the Earth in a straight line, which eclipse occurs?','Lunar Eclipse','Solar Eclipse','Planetary Eclipse','Stellar Eclipse','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(273,3,17,475,1,'MH_07_Q078','Tides in the ocean are primarily caused by the gravitational attraction of _____.','Mars','The Sun and the Moon','Jupiter','Venus','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(274,3,17,476,1,'MH_07_Q079','Air pressure is measured using which instrument?','Thermometer','Barometer','Anemometer','Hygrometer','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(275,3,17,479,1,'MH_07_Q080','Which factor plays a major role in soil formation from parent rock?','Weathering','Mining','Deforestation','Urbanization','A',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(276,3,17,475,1,'MH_07_Q081','High tides that occur on New Moon and Full Moon days are called _____.','Neap Tides','Spring Tides','Ebb Tides','Low Tides','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(277,3,17,477,1,'MH_07_Q082','Winds that blow regularly from high pressure belts to low pressure belts throughout the year are called _____.','Local Winds','Planetary Winds','Seasonal Winds','Monsoon Winds','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(278,3,17,478,1,'MH_07_Q083','In which natural region are dense tropical rainforests (Equatorial forests) found?','Tundra Region','Equatorial Region','Hot Desert Region','Taiga Region','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(279,3,17,481,1,'MH_07_Q084','Cultivation of crops mainly for family consumption without commercial selling is called _____.','Commercial Agriculture','Subsistence Agriculture','Plantation Agriculture','Extensive Agriculture','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(280,3,17,482,1,'MH_07_Q085','Settlements formed along roads, railway lines, or river banks are called _____ settlements.','Nucleated','Linear','Dispersed','Circular','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(281,3,17,476,1,'MH_07_Q086','Why does air pressure decrease with increasing altitude?','Air becomes denser at high altitude','Air column above decreases and air molecules become less dense','Temperature drops to absolute zero','Gravity increases with height','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(282,3,17,477,1,'MH_07_Q087','What causes the deflection of winds to the right in the Northern Hemisphere and to the left in the Southern Hemisphere?','Centrifugal Force','Coriolis Effect (due to Earth\'s rotation)','Gravitational Force','Frictional Force','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(283,3,17,480,1,'MH_07_Q088','On which two dates of the year do Equinoxes occur (equal day and night everywhere on Earth)?','21st June & 22nd December','21st March & 23rd September','1st January & 1st July','15th August & 26th January','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(284,3,17,478,1,'MH_07_Q089','Why do animals in the Tundra region have thick fur and layer of fat (blubber)?','To swim faster','To protect themselves from extreme cold climate','To blend with desert sand','To climb tall trees','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(285,3,17,483,1,'MH_07_Q090','On a contour map, when contour lines are drawn very close to each other, what does it indicate?','Gentle slope','Steep slope','Flat plain','Deep ocean basin','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(286,3,18,484,1,'MH_07_Q091','Forts, monuments, and coins belong to which source of history?','Oral sources','Material sources','Written sources','Digital sources','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(287,3,18,485,1,'MH_07_Q092','Who was the founder of the Mughal Empire in India?','Akbar','Babur','Humayun','Aurangzeb','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(288,3,18,488,1,'MH_07_Q093','Where was Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj born?','Raigad','Shivneri Fort','Torna Fort','Pratapgad','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(289,3,18,490,1,'MH_07_Q094','What was the council of eight ministers formed by Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj called?','Ashtapradhan Mandal','Navaratna Mandal','Sabha','Mantri Parishad','A',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(290,3,18,497,1,'MH_07_Q095','Who is known as the Father of the Indian Constitution?','Mahatma Gandhi','Dr. B.R. Ambedkar','Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru','Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel','B',NULL,'Easy',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(291,3,18,486,1,'MH_07_Q096','Which saint played a key role in propagating the Varkari movement in Maharashtra through Abhangas?','Sant Dnyaneshwar and Sant Tukaram','Kabir','Guru Nanak','Mirabai','A',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(292,3,18,489,1,'MH_07_Q097','Which general was sent by Aurangzeb to defeat Shivaji Maharaj and capture Maratha forts in 1665?','Shaista Khan','Jaysing (Mirza Raja Jaysing)','Afzal Khan','Siddi Jauhar','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(293,3,18,491,1,'MH_07_Q098','Why is Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj remembered as an ideal ruler?','He imposed high taxes','He protected women, respected all religions, and cared for peasants','He only focused on expansion without administration','He abandoned agriculture','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(294,3,18,492,1,'MH_07_Q099','Who led the Maratha Empire after the death of Chhatrapati Sambhaji Maharaj and Rajaram Maharaj with great courage?','Maharani Tarabai','Jijabai','Soyarabai','Umabai Dabhade','A',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(295,3,18,498,1,'MH_07_Q100','What does the term \'Sovereign\' in the Preamble of Indian Constitution signify?','India is governed by a foreign king','India is an independent country free from external control','India has no laws','India is ruled by military','B',NULL,'Average',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(296,3,18,487,1,'MH_07_Q101','Before Swaraj, who were the two main Sultanates ruling over major parts of Maharashtra?','Adilshahi of Bijapur and Nizamshahi of Ahmadnagar','Mughals and British','Portuguese and French','Kutubshahi and Cholas','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(297,3,18,490,1,'MH_07_Q102','Who held the post of \'Peshwa\' in the Ashtapradhan Mandal under Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj?','Moro Trimbak Pingle','Ramchandra Pant Amatya','Hambirrao Mohite','Annaji Datto','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(298,3,18,493,1,'MH_07_Q103','Which treaty established Maratha supremacy and the right to collect Chauthai and Sardeshmukhi in North India?','Treaty of Purandar','Sanads obtained by Peshwa Balaji Vishwanath (1719)','Treaty of Vasai','Treaty of Salbai','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(299,3,18,499,1,'MH_07_Q104','What is the key principle of the \'Federal System\' adopted in India?','Division of power between Central government and State governments','All powers given to municipalities only','Single supreme dictator','No central government','A',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56'),(300,3,18,500,1,'MH_07_Q105','Which Right allows citizens to move court if their Fundamental Rights are violated?','Right to Equality','Right to Constitutional Remedies','Right to Freedom of Religion','Cultural Rights','B',NULL,'Difficult',1,60,'2026-08-07 10:32:56');
